# config/ui/pack_prefixes.sdn — pack-name -> path-prefix map for
# scripts/check/check-ui-slim-pack-inventory.shs (A10, doc/03_plan/ui/slim_kernel_plugin/plan.md).
# One row per pack: "name, prefix". Order matters: a file is classified into
# the FIRST pack whose prefix it matches, so put more specific prefixes
# before their parents (e.g. gpu/browser_engine before gpu). "other" carries
# no prefix and is the catch-all for anything matching none of the rows
# above it — it MUST be last and MUST NOT appear in the on-disk existence
# check (see the guide doc).
#
# Every prefix here other than "other" is verified to exist on disk by the
# gate; a prefix that does not exist is treated as a stale-config ERROR, not
# a silently-empty pack. As of 2026-09-06 four of the prefixes below do NOT
# exist yet (parser/layout/widgets/session/draw_ir partially aspirational —
# see the guide's "Known stale prefixes" section) which is itself a real,
# reportable finding: the design's pack taxonomy is ahead of what has been
# carved out of src/lib/common/ui and src/lib/nogc_sync_mut/ui so far.
parser, src/lib/common/ui/parse
layout, src/lib/common/ui/layout
widgets, src/lib/common/ui/widget
session, src/lib/nogc_sync_mut/ui/session
draw_ir, src/lib/common/ui/draw_ir
web_ir, src/lib/gc_async_mut/gpu/browser_engine
browser, src/lib/common/web
compositor, src/os/compositor
drivers, src/os/drivers
kernel, src/os/kernel
skia, src/lib/skia
gpu, src/lib/gc_async_mut/gpu
text_layout, src/lib/nogc_sync_mut/text_layout
io, src/lib/nogc_sync_mut/io
io, src/lib/io_runtime.spl
concurrent, src/lib/nogc_async_mut/concurrent
composition, src/lib/nogc_sync_mut/composition
tiny, src/lib/nogc_sync_mut/tiny
other,
